# lib/ is deliberately COMMITTED: DSH activates a plugin by reading
# lib/client.js from disk, and `dsh plugin add github:<owner>/<repo>` clones the
# repository without necessarily running a build. Shipping the artifact keeps
# that install path working.
!lib/
